            <title><![CDATA[American imprisoned by Russia released as Witkoff meets and praises Putin]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/american-imprisoned-by-russia-released-as-witkoff-meets-and-praises-putin</link>
            <description><![CDATA[Russia freed an American imprisoned for the last four years. Stephen Hubbard was captured in Eastern Ukraine and convicted of fighting against Russia. The 74-year-old retired teacher was reportedly freed without a swap. U.S. special envoy Steve Witkoff greeted Hubbard in St. Petersburg. He also met with the Russian president and praised Putin in unusually glowing terms. Nick Schifrin reports.]]></description>
